{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_030_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2908dd89a62e2642d990667332fd3bdae257f72b620ef68593d1f878d0e4df8b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24718878ddf083bbb984f270ec0f464e3bc60bab842a6f874b14c489401da8ea",
      "text": "从制作人那里收到的巧克力，很好吃\n哦。一转眼就被我吃光了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f873428a4914231b30b2ce2ca5e0832af6d223166264d8344aab698183517dfa",
      "text": "你能喜欢真是太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a014a6330999d4ced55e452d54a0dde5820e347cf86913c73a0030628ab5e850",
      "text": "……那个，制作人会不会也想吃点\n甜食呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:517a83b1508aaa60e6100c3c39da3c908d2e938ca75d7964c65eee6955a01ab6",
      "text": "其实今天，在来这里之前，\n我顺道去了我中意的那家蛋糕店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbcfcacd65f42db4a5b6ee5b8d8bb5d2f8869a01ac8cac279fa0e835f806a2c4",
      "text": "买到了情人节限定的巧克力蛋糕，\n要不要一起吃呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b75e8bfbd1105adfbe1a2e1345100576898757988cc42f8d70aeb3a9c5cd88c0",
      "text": "那看起来真美味呢！非常感谢，\n那我去泡点茶过来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb195a03e5deda97dc9dfb3a0f2b527b10f3683abc8bb09871e31f8167a5255",
      "text": "啊，由我来泡吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a03b2bf1c38680280086a6f1c908beba3450482c4d914e4bdc600901cfada10",
      "text": "没关系的哦。\n请交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_030_23:5_01_030_23_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0928e0840c12a44d2ca1cbb12d8a00019f910afccb8f6c35dd158b0e05316ee2",
      "text": "呵呵……能和制作人\n一起吃蛋糕……好高兴啊♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
